      "map": 14,
      "name": "拉卡湖的激戰",
      "native_death_programs": {
        "2:39": [
          {
            "native_death_op": {
              "kind": 0,
              "op": "reward",
              "value": 211
            },
            "native_event_id": 39,
            "native_source": "0x34f83",
            "type": "native_death_op"
          },
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFEE",
              "line": 0,
              "operand": 17,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『咦？這．這不是「光之眼」",
                  "　寶石嗎？為何獸人族也在收",
                  "　集這些東西．．』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 3,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 11,
              "utterance": 0
            },
            "native_event_id": 39,
            "native_source": "0x34f9e",
            "native_text_index": 11,
            "type": "dialogue"
          },
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFEE",
              "line": 1,
              "operand": 14,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『傳說中的「魔眼寶石」嗎？",
                  "　我聽老師說過，聽說它們有",
                  "　強大的魔力，但這和獸人族"
                ],
                [
                  "　有什麼關係？．．』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 3,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 11,
              "utterance": 1
            },
            "native_event_id": 39,
            "native_source": "0x34f9e",
            "native_text_index": 11,
            "type": "dialogue"
          },
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFEE",
              "line": 2,
              "operand": 17,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『妳也知道嗎？據說它們的償",
                  "　值並不只是魔力而已，而是",
                  "　和一件古代的秘密有很大的"
                ],
                [
                  "　關係．．』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 3,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 11,
              "utterance": 2
            },
            "native_event_id": 39,
            "native_source": "0x34f9e",
            "native_text_index": 11,
            "type": "dialogue"
          },
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFEE",
              "line": 3,
              "operand": 0,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『你們在談些什麼？",
                  "　好像很有趣的樣子！』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 3,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 11,
              "utterance": 3
            },
            "native_event_id": 39,
            "native_source": "0x34f9e",
            "native_text_index": 11,
            "type": "dialogue"
          },
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFEE",
              "line": 4,
              "operand": 17,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『不聊了，",
                  "　先把仗打完再說！』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 3,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 11,
              "utterance": 4
            },
            "native_event_id": 39,
            "native_source": "0x34f9e",
            "native_text_index": 11,
            "type": "dialogue"
          }
        ],
        "3:7": [
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFED",
              "line": 1,
              "operand": 64,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『師父，",
                  "　我對不起您．．』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 2,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 7,
              "utterance": 0
            },
            "native_source": "0x1ac49",
            "native_text_index": 7,
            "type": "dialogue"
          }
        ],
        "3:9": [
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFED",
              "line": 3,
              "operand": 16,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『．啊．主人，救救我．",
                  "　你答應要給我．",
                  "　給我力量和．"
                ],
                [
                  "　永恆的．生命的．．』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 2,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 9,
              "utterance": 0
            },
            "native_source": "0x1ac49",
            "native_text_index": 9,
            "type": "dialogue"
          },
          {
            "native_dialogue_ref": {
              "control": "FFEE",
              "line": 4,
              "operand": 0,
              "pages": [
                [
                  "『糟啦，這一下打得太重了些",
                  "　等一下沒人可以問話了，",
                  "　可惜可惜。』"
                ]
              ],
              "scene_index": 2,
              "script": "assets/story/ch15.json",
              "source_dat": "FDTXT_015",
              "string_index": 9,
              "utterance": 1
            },
            "native_source": "0x1ac49",
